body:
@lizpearl 

> Also curious why the trigger is a branch vs pull request.

We use the branch option on get.gov, and it's really helpful for previewing before creating the pull request. So someone can get a branch all ready, and create the PR only once it's ready!

@therealslimhsiehdy  thanks for the suggestions!

> were those blank columns intentional for the different CSVs?

I'll look but I think that's just because those CSVs don't have columns out there, and that's how it gets rendered. But will see if there's another path to make it look less weird.

@sylvesterkaczmarek  thanks for the input! Made a change to address that risk.
